/-- And so they occupy at most `dist a b` of Lebesgue measure, which is the form
`SkorokhodSpace.intWith_le_of_ae_distWith_le` consumes. -/
theorem volume_radius_exhaustionMax_mem_Ico (t₀ : ι) (a b : ι) :
