/-- **The left limit passes through post-composition.**  It is
`leftLim_eq_of_tendsto` applied to `IsCadlag.tendsto_nhdsLT_leftLim` followed by
the continuity of the map, and over the index `ℝ` the instance `(𝓝[<] t₀).NeBot`
